(2,10,1,1,2,1,3,'2D Array','Write a C program to perform matrix addition of two 3x3 matrices.','C','Easy','Converted',1,NULL,0,13,'2026-01-29 11:18:50','2026-01-30 11:18:02','2026-01-30 11:17:59'),
(3,13,1,1,2,1,NULL,'Structure program','Consider a structure as follows:\nstruct stud_info \n{ \nint rno; \nchar sname[30]; \nint marks; \n};\nWrite a C program that accepts details of N-students and displays student\'s details in descending order on marks.','C','Easy','Converted',1,NULL,0,12,'2026-01-29 11:47:05','2026-01-30 11:17:57','2026-01-30 11:17:53'),
(4,13,1,1,2,1,NULL,'Python String program','Write a Python program that accepts a line of text from the user and performs following operations on it.\n i) Toggle case \nii) Title case \niii) Sentence case\n iv) Exit \nNote: Menu will be repeated until the user selects the Exit option.','Python','','Converted',1,NULL,0,11,'2026-01-30 10:38:29','2026-01-30 11:17:52','2026-01-30 11:17:49'),
(5,13,1,1,2,1,16,'**Program to Find the Application with the Highest Rating Using Structure**','Create structure App Data with following members: \nApp Name, download Count, rating, developer\n Accept 5 Application details from the user and print details of the application whose rating is highest.','C','','Converted',1,NULL,0,10,'2026-01-30 10:42:18','2026-01-30 11:17:48','2026-01-30 11:17:46'),
(6,9,1,1,2,1,3,'Matrix Addition of Two 3×3 Matrices Using C','Write a C program to perform matrix addition of two 3x3 matrices.','C','Medium','Converted',1,NULL,0,9,'2026-01-30 10:42:57','2026-01-30 11:17:35','2026-01-30 11:17:32'),
(7,13,1,1,2,1,14,'**Python Program to Perform Operations on a List of Student Names**','Write a Python program to create a list of student\'s names and perform following operations on it.\ni. Append Name in a list.\nii. Display list in sorted order.\niii. Count the total number of students in the list.\niv. Display the last 3 names of a list.','Python','','Converted',1,NULL,1,8,'2026-01-30 10:44:34','2026-01-30 12:37:30','2026-01-30 11:17:27'),
(8,9,1,1,2,1,4,'Removing Duplicate Characters from a String Using Python','Write a Python program that accepts a line of text (which consists of multiple words) from the input device. Remove duplicate characters from it and make a line of text unique','Python','Hard','Converted',1,NULL,0,7,'2026-01-30 10:44:52','2026-01-30 11:17:26','2026-01-30 11:17:23'),
(9,9,1,1,2,1,5,'C Program to Return the Maximum of Three Numbers','Write a C program to create a user defined function max () which accepts 3- numbers and returns the maximum number from them.','C','Easy','Converted',1,NULL,0,6,'2026-01-30 10:47:20','2026-01-30 11:17:22','2026-01-30 11:17:19'),
(10,9,1,1,2,1,17,'DataFrame Operations on Book Details Using Pandas','Create a DataFrame from a CSV file which contains following values. \nBook_no, Book_name, Price, Author Perform following operations on it: \n1. Print the values of the book name. \n2. Display book name and author.\n3. Display the details of a book named \'Let us C\'.\n4. Display the details of the book at location 3rd .','Python','Hard','Converted',NULL,NULL,1,5,'2026-01-30 10:48:29','2026-01-30 11:17:14',NULL),
