INSERT INTO `tbl_student_reviews` VALUES
(2,'Ammar Tapia','Python','2022','I was not able to write logic based code even after 2 yrs of College. After then I went  for this course where fahad Sir teach me best of best practical and theory session where I got confidence while building software solutions. Thanks Fahad Sir for this amazing course of Python which you teach me.',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 08:13:53'),
(3,'Kinjal Champaneria','Web development','2023-2026','My experience at AppXwinD Technology has been very good. Specially with fahad sir , I learned many useful computer skills and gained practical knowledge beyond my studies. Sir always guided and supported us, which made learning easy and interesting. I am really thankful for this wonderful learning experience.',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 08:19:41'),
(4,'hritik Khatri','BCA','BCA sem - 6 / 2026','I started learning at Appexwind about two months ago. During this time, I gained practical exposure to web development concepts and improved my understanding of programming and project structure. The learning environment is supportive, and the mentors explain technical topics in a clear and practical way.\r\nWorking on real tasks helped me understand how development works in a real-world environment rather than just theory. I also improved my problem-solving skills and confidence while working with different tools and technologies.\r\nOverall, my experience with Appexwind has been positive so far, and it has helped me strengthen my technical skills and prepare better for a career in the IT field.',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 08:36:20'),
(5,'Saloni Jariwala','Java','2018','Best teacher',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 09:17:18'),
(6,'Jasmin Shah','College','2015-17','He became my first friend when I came to Surat, \r\n Hamne aek hi banch pe padhai ki thi aur project bhi sath me Kiya tha, \r\nHe is the  Best Teacher from his Colleage Time.',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 09:45:47'),
(7,'AAMIR SHAIKH','DBMS,DS','2025','Maine AppXwind mein classes li aur mera experience kaafi achha raha. Yahan par mujhe naye skills sikhne ka mauka mila aur concepts ko simple tareeke se samjhaya gaya. Teachers ka support bhi achha tha aur learning environment friendly tha',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 09:59:53'),
(8,'Krutika Jariwala','BCA','2023-2026','I build my confidance from zero to hero coding by Fahad sir and at the time of internship i build my strength to start my career in IT industry by kishan sir, Thank You both of you.❤️',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 11:19:35'),
(10,'Choksi M. Ibrahim M. Amin','Internship in API Development and Implementation in PHP','2026','It\'s been a great experience in AppXwinD Technology. I do an internship there in December 25 to January 26. It\'s been a one month internship in API Development and Implementation in PHP where I first understand what is API and how we implement in vs code and run our web application using API. Then after words we start learning Postman, Swagger, and Supabase etc. Also both sir Mr. Fahad Vahora Sir and Mr. Kishan Patel Sir both are cooperative with Students. And also I know about various types of AI which help in creating our application. And in last, thankyou to both sir for their truly efforts. And it\'s been an amazing journey for this organization',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 11:29:04'),
(11,'Dave Vidisha','API Testing using Postman','2025-2026','I had a one-month internship with Fahad Sir. His teaching techniques are very clear and easy to understand, which helped me learn quickly. Even though I was not introduced to everyone in the company, Fahad Sir and Kishan Sir were always very kind and supportive. Whenever I faced any errors, they patiently helped me solve them. Even after my internship ended, they still guide me whenever needed. I’m very grateful for their support and guidance.',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 12:12:37'),
(12,'Naam se kya hi karoge phir bhi lo - Param Dange','BCA karna pada majboori','Itna yaad hota toh a','Vo sab toh theek hai lekin by default rating kyu max diya hai 😂. \r\n\r\nVese sir ne jo bhi aaj tak padhaya hai boht mast padhaya hai .',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 14:30:58'),
(13,'Rajvi Jariwala','C++, OOP, PHP','2023,2024','Best classes I ever had. Each and every Topics were covered in detailed. I enjoyed it.',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 16:23:43'),
(14,'Riya Jariwala','Java & .NET','2024-2025','I am learning .NET, and my understanding is increasing significantly.\r\nI am consistently on the right track; I will keep up the great work! 😊',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 17:18:35'),
(15,'Gheewala Dev','Phyton, Java , C++ COURSE','2022-23','I got  the excellent understanding and clear the all the problems that ocurs in  the program .\r\nMake the relationship like friends',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 17:55:55'),
(16,'Mohammad Umer','Web Development','2025 - 2026','He is Very supportive Sir👍👍👍',5,'approved','','2026-03-08 17:56:10'),
(17,'Dharmika Jariwala','Java & .NET','2025-2026','I\'m currently attending the tuition classes for .NET and it\'s being very helpful to me as it\'s help me understand concept very clearly and coherently and improving my understanding of programming.',5,'approved','','2026-03-09 05:48:56'),
(18,'Faizal Malek','IT','2024','As a student from a non-IT background, entering the tech field felt like a huge challenge. However, Fahad Sir’s guidance changed everything for me. He taught me everything from the absolute basics to advanced concepts with great patience. Thanks to his mentorship, I not only cleared my MCA but also successfully secured an internship. I am truly grateful for his support in building my career from scratch.',5,'approved','','2026-03-11 07:46:56'),
(19,'Dhruv Rana','BCA (Web Development)','2025-2026','\"My experience at AppXwinD Technology has been excellent. Especially with Fahad, sir, I learned many useful computer skills and gained practical knowledge beyond my studies. Sir always guided and supported us, which made learning simple and interesting. I am really thankful for this wonderful learning experience.\"',5,'approved','','2026-03-11 11:36:53');
